                <p>After “ADF Super member”, insert “covered by paragraph (b) of this subsection”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-2__amdact-2__item-7">
              <num>12</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 68AA(9)(b)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the paragraph, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-2__amdact-2__item-7__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-2__amdact-2__item-7__qstr-1__para-b">
